# Code owners for this repository.
#
# The owner is a required reviewer only for two things:
#   (a) guardrails: anything that, if silently weakened, would stop an agent
#       guardrail or a required check protecting us. Here that is the rules and
#       the owner's instructions, the gate scripts and the tests the required
#       checks run, the hook config contributors run, this file and its proof
#       tool, and (through the shared /.github/ line) the workflows.
#   (b) human-facing docs: the README and the licence text.
# Everything else (the Pulumi project and program, package and install files,
# the image pin, the theme, the other scripts, engineering docs) merges on a
# signed commit, green checks and the reviewer App's approval.
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern to a path, and a line that names no
# owner releases the path. There is deliberately no catch-all `*` line: a path
# is owned only because a line below names it.
#
# `scripts/codeowners_owned.py` answers "is this path owned" for a fixed table
# of sample paths, one per kept class and one per released class, and its test
# runs in the secret-free job. Edit this file and that table together.

# Guardrails: the rules and the owner's own instructions.
CLAUDE.md                  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
AUTHORISATIONS.md          @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.claude/                  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# Guardrails: the gate scripts the required checks and the plan and deploy jobs
# run, and the tests of them. The committed-secret guard and its test are the
# required 'Committed-secret guard' check; the render test proves the stack
# records no secret. This file's proof tool, its test and its fixture are here
# too.
/scripts/assert-*.py                      @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/scripts/test_assert_*.py                 @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/scripts/test_secret_checks.py            @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/scripts/test_plan_job.py                 @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/scripts/test_verify_attestations_job.py  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/scripts/codeowners_owned.py              @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/scripts/test_codeowners_owned.py         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/scripts/testdata/codeowners/             @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/test/render.test.ts                      @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# What runs on a contributor's machine before a commit.
.pre-commit-config.yaml    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# Human-facing docs: the README and the licence text.
/README.md                 @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
LICENSE                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# The shared set below is the standards escape hatches, copied byte for byte,
# and must stay the final lines: nothing after or between them. The workflows,
# dependabot.yml and this file are under /.github/.
/.standardsignore        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.standards.mode         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.docs-lint*             @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.standards-db-tooling   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.github/                @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
